[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Lapin UX: give back desktop settings
Comment=If a Lapin UX session didn't end cleanly, puts this desktop's font, icons and pointer back
Exec=lapin-ux-desktop-settings leave
NotShowIn=LapinUX;
NoDisplay=true
X-GNOME-Autostart-Phase=Initialization
X-KDE-autostart-phase=0
